Feature: gitignore check should work for .yaks or .yaks/

  Rule: yx accepts both .yaks and .yaks/ as valid gitignore entries
    Example: .gitignore contains ".yaks" — no onboarding prompt
    Example: .gitignore contains ".yaks/" — no onboarding prompt
    Example: .gitignore contains neither — onboarding prompt shown

  Rule: add_yaks_to_gitignore skips adding when already present
    Example: .gitignore already has ".yaks" — no duplicate added
    Example: .gitignore already has ".yaks/" — no duplicate added
